From 7115dccc3b62ff2170d864fec2cdc00d8f029e4f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 05:41:12 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 02/11] Day screen: let the server copy replace a bundled copy
 pinned on a cold open

A day opened before GET /api/paths had landed (direct link, Onboarding's
Day 1, a notification, a slow network) pinned the bundled fallback for the
life of the screen. She saw different words from the CMS copy everyone else
saw, and where the two copies name a step differently every answer was
refused (404 step_not_found) and stayed queued behind "Guardando tu lugar".

The bundled pin is now provisional (lib/dayPin): it gives way to the CMS copy
once, when that arrives, while she has not answered from this screen, or later
when the server day has the same steps (only the words change). The resume
position is taken again for the new copy, and the screens memo now follows the
pinned steps so the words actually change.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MRH1FyKGTN3zfVru4KrGk9
