 now

Follow-up to "Hoy waits for her own progress": the progress read is now
re-applied when the store changes hands, and without a check a read that
outlived a Log out (or a change of account) could hand the signed-out
store the last account's progress and mark it hers. SessionSync applies
the read only when the account it was made for is the session's own
(readFor), as profileFor already does for /api/me.

Tests: query.test.ts (readFor).

