or not, so a draft's existence only said she had been on the step, and a
day she only opened still read «Vas en el paso 1 de 2. Guardamos lo que
escribiste.» Today's entry now counts a draft only when it holds something
she gave: words, a choice, a mark, a photo (draftHasWords).

